# Sources of truth

Do **not** invent product, structure, design, naming, or scope answers.
Authorities live in files. Rules only restates expensive mistakes.

## Always on (injected every chat)

| File | Covers |
|---|---|
| `AGENTS.md` | Product, core loop, roles, vocabulary, market, repo boundary, deferred scope, open questions, listing-price UI (`PriceWithCommission`), list filter chrome (marketplace band vs Filters sheet), conditional property filters |
| `.cursor/rules/structure.mdc` | Where code lives (full detail: `docs/STRUCTURE.md`) |
| `.cursor/rules/001-hard-constraints.mdc` | Cross-cutting constraints that affect planning before any file is open |

## Docs — read the matching one before that kind of work

| Doc | When |
|---|---|
| `docs/STRUCTURE.md` | Creating any file or folder |
| `docs/DESIGN.md` | Colour, type, spacing, layout, components (incl. §5.6–5.7 filter chrome + conditional filters) |
| `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM-SYNC.md` | Adding/changing tokens, fonts, shadows |
| `docs/NAMING.md` | Naming files, folders, ids, types, API fields |
| `docs/REUSE.md` | Tokens vs utilities vs shared components |
| `docs/PERFORMANCE.md` | Fetching, caching, lists, images, `"use client"` |
| `docs/MOTION.md` | Animation, hover/tap/focus, Motion primitives |
| `docs/MESSAGES.md` | Errors, validation, success, jargon in UI copy |
| `docs/EMPTY_STATES.md` | First-run / filtered / cleared empty views |
| `docs/LOADING.md` | Skeletons, spinners, button pending, `loading.tsx` |
| `docs/SHORTCUTS.md` | Keyboard shortcuts (`config/shortcuts.ts`) |

Matching `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` files also apply via globs when those files are open.
If a rule and its doc disagree, the **doc** wins (except `AGENTS.md`, which wins on product/scope).

## Engagement

- Open questions in `AGENTS.md` → ask; do not pick an answer.
- Durable new facts → propose adding to `AGENTS.md` or the relevant `docs/*.md`, not only chat.
- Skills under `.cursor/skills/` are for design/polish workflows — load the skill when that work starts; do not assume they are already loaded.
